// f32 `asinh`, `acosh` and `atanh`, ported from LLVM libc into `core::libm`, against LLVM
// libc itself. For each input, given by its bits, this prints the bits of the three results
// (a NaN as 2143289344). The expected line is what LLVM libc at f475f085bf7b prints,
// built with FMA. The inputs are every boundary between the code's branches with its two
// neighbours, every input LLVM libc special-cases, an input reaching each entry of the
// `log` tables, inputs through `atanh`'s Taylor series, zeros, a NaN and a few ordinary
// values, each with both signs; and 1163522503 (about 3489.9), whose `acosh` lies so near a
// rounding boundary that the `log` kernel's smallest term decides it. The port was also checked against LLVM libc on all 2^32 inputs.
//
// EXPECT: 0 2143289344 0 847249407 2143289344 847249407 847249408 2143289344 847249408 847249409 2143289344 847249409 925353388 2143289344 925353388 1022736672 2143289344 1022743921 1028437755 2143289344 1028454543 1032797761 2143289344 1032820808 1035473524 2143289344 1035522546 1036742902 2143289344 1036809175 1036757509 2143289344 1036824001 1036757510 2143289344 1036824002 1036757511 2143289344 1036824003 1036796324 2143289344 1036863401 1040144005 2143289344 1040231496 1040144006 2143289344 1040231497 1040144008 2143289344 1040231498 1056334181 2143289344 1057791828 1063244065 2143289344 1076454083 1063362994 2143289344 1091215651 1063362995 0 2139095040 1063362996 973078528 2143289344 1069074700 1068012052 2143289344 1072218843 1071751603 2143289344 1084853253 1084853148 2143289344 1091410305 1091410305 2143289344 1091579059 1091579059 2143289344 1091579059 1091579059 2143289344 1091579060 1091579060 2143289344 1091886949 1091886949 2143289344 1092148827 1092148827 2143289344 1092735948 1092735948 2143289344 1097915536 1097915536 2143289344 1099604259 1099604259 2143289344 1099604259 1099604259 2143289344 1099604259 1099604259 2143289344 1099891531 1099891530 2143289344 1099968438 1099968438 2143289344 1099976555 1099976555 2143289344 1099984548 1099984548 2143289344 1099992421 1099992421 2143289344 1100000178 1100000178 2143289344 1100007821 1100007821 2143289344 1100015355 1100015355 2143289344 1100022782 1100022782 2143289344 1100030105 1100030105 2143289344 1100037327 1100037327 2143289344 1100044452 1100044452 2143289344 1100051480 1100051480 2143289344 1100058416 1100058416 2143289344 1100065261 1100065261 2143289344 1100072018 1100072018 2143289344 1100078689 1100078689 2143289344 1100085276 1100085276 2143289344 1100091781 1100091781 2143289344 1100098207 1100098207 2143289344 1100104555 1100104555 2143289344 1100110827 1100110827 2143289344 1100117024 1100117024 2143289344 1100123150 1100123150 2143289344 1100129204 1100129204 2143289344 1100135190 1